From c9edc6894fc6d510301d75ba9df206e9fbc59381 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Varun-iiitb <var3907@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:46:18 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 06/44] Add liveness strings to app_en.arb

The 43 liveness_* keys of docs/ui-liveness-spec.md section 5 (Mosip26),
copied from the spec's ARB block: titles, status, challenges, feedback,
guidance, errors, tips, retry and progress (with int placeholders),
recovery texts per workflow and buttons.

The other languages (ar, fr, hi, kn, ta) do not have them yet; gen-l10n
generates their getters with the English text (checked in the generated
French file), so those screens show English until the translations come.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 assets/l10n/app_en.arb | 48 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 47 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/assets/l10n/app_en.arb b/assets/l10n/app_en.arb
index 0012c53..b8e6be1 100644
--- a/assets/l10n/app_en.arb
+++ b/assets/l10n/app_en.arb
@@ -368,5 +368,51 @@
